00:11:19,740 --> 00:11:22,170
Why do you have bags? Why does she have bags?
你怎麼帶行李？ 她為什麼帶行李？

165
00:11:22,610 --> 00:11:24,170
I'm staying with you guys.
我要和你們住一塊了

166
00:11:24,350 --> 00:11:26,470
- What? - We're gonna be roomies!
- 什麼？ -我們是同居室友了！

167
00:11:26,650 --> 00:11:27,710
Come on.
來。

168
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:36,850
- You slept out here? - Yeah.
-你睡在外面？ - 是啊！

169
00:11:37,020 --> 00:11:40,890
Amy kept kicking me in her sleep, yelling, "Myron, get off!"
她夢中把我踢出來 還叫囂什麼：馬瑞，滾出去！

170
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:46,060
But we're getting rid of her, right? Please tell me we're getting rid of her?
我們會把她趕走對吧？ 答應我，趕走她

171
00:11:46,230 --> 00:11:48,600
- Joey, I can't do that. - Oh, come on.
-我下不了手，喬伊 -噢, 不會吧.

172
00:11:48,770 --> 00:11:51,330
Last night I was finishing off a pizza, and she said:
昨晚我剛吃完一半披薩，她就說

173
00:11:51,510 --> 00:11:54,030
"A moment on the lips, forever on the hips."
嘴上爽一把，屁股胖一生

174
00:11:55,610 --> 00:11:58,510
I don't need that kind of talk in my house!
在我家不許說這種話！

175
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:00,870
Joey, look, I know that she's difficult..
喬伊，我知道她難相處

176
00:12:01,050 --> 00:12:03,380
but I think it's really good that she's here.
但她來這裡也不錯

177
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:07,880
Because we'll appreciate it more when she's gone?
這樣她滾蛋後我們才能更歡喜？

178
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:13,560
No, it's just.. Look, when I first moved to this city, I was a lot like her.
我剛搬來還不是一樣

179
00:12:13,730 --> 00:12:18,170
I was spoiled, self-centered. And you guys really took care of me.
被慣壞，自我中心 你們幾個卻照顧我

180
00:12:18,330 --> 00:12:20,300
Yeah. Monica made us.
莫妮卡強迫我們來著

181
00:12:21,740 --> 00:12:24,100
Well, whatever. I really appreciate it..
不管怎樣我都很感激

182
00:12:24,270 --> 00:12:27,140
because I don't think I would be the person I am today..
如果沒有你們

183
00:12:27,310 --> 00:12:29,140
if it wasn't for you guys.
也就沒有現在的我

184
00:12:29,310 --> 00:12:31,740
So I want to help Amy the way you guys helped me.
我想幫幫艾米，就像你們幫我那樣

185
00:12:31,910 --> 00:12:35,180
And I know it's gonna take patience, but that's okay.
我知道這需要極大的耐性，我可以

186
00:12:36,180 --> 00:12:38,910
- Good morning. - Yeah.
-早 -早

187
00:12:39,890 --> 00:12:43,580
That's what I'm wearing today. That's why I hung it on the door.
艾米，那是我今天要穿的衣服 所以我才掛在門上。

188
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:46,350
Oh, sweetie, you can't pull this off.
寶貝，你總不能給我扒下來

189
00:12:51,070 --> 00:12:54,690
You know what? I was thinking that maybe now would be a good time..
你知道嗎，現在我們也許應當坐下來

190
00:12:54,870 --> 00:12:58,670
for us to sit down and, you know, talk about your future.
好好談談你的將來

191
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:01,740
Oh, I can't, honey. I'm gonna go get my eyebrows shaped.
我沒空，我要去修眉

192
00:13:01,910 --> 00:13:03,310
I am not happy.
這樣的眉毛像哭喪著臉

193
00:13:06,410 --> 00:13:08,750
Sure you want to eat that?
你真要吃剩下的一半？

194
00:13:10,820 --> 00:13:13,650
I'm curvy and I like it!
我就是想增加曲線美，我喜歡！

195
00:13:17,690 --> 00:13:19,390
- Hi. - Hi.
-嗨！ -嗨！

196
00:13:19,590 --> 00:13:22,290
I just had the worst anniversary ever.
最爛的週年慶！

197
00:13:22,460 --> 00:13:24,590
I doubt that. Tell her about us last year.
才不是呢 莫妮卡，給她講講我們去年怎麼過的週年

198
00:13:24,770 --> 00:13:30,100
Well, I bought Chandler a $500 watch, and he wrote me a rap song.
我給錢德買了500圓一隻的表。 而他，給我寫了首饒舌歌。

199
00:13:32,340 --> 00:13:34,830
- Seriously? - Word.
-真的？ -是..

200
00:13:37,140 --> 00:13:38,410
Mine was worse than that.
我的比你還遜

201
00:13:38,580 --> 00:13:40,740
- Well, what happened? - We were at the game.
-怎麼啦？ -球賽時

202
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:43,710
This guy proposed to his girlfriend on the big screen thing.
有人在大屏幕上求婚

203
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:46,650
- That is so tacky. - Well, that's what I said.
-老套！ -我也是那麼說

204
00:13:46,820 --> 00:13:51,450
But it turns out Mike was planning to propose to me that same way last night.
結果呢，原來麥克昨晚上就想用 這種方式向我求婚！

205
00:13:51,630 --> 00:13:53,620
Oh, my God. Mike was gonna propose?
天，麥克要求婚？

206
00:13:53,790 --> 00:13:55,960
- That's huge. - Do you want to marry him?
-大事件！ -你想嫁他嗎？

207
00:13:56,130 --> 00:13:58,290
Yeah, I really do. Yes.
當然想啦！

208
00:13:58,470 --> 00:14:00,870
But after I dumped on the way he was gonna do it..
結果我那句話把他堵回去了

209
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:05,500
I don't think he'll ever ask again. I said no in Barbados, and now this?
我想他一輩子都不會求婚了。 在巴貝多我拒絕過他一次了，現在又

210
00:14:05,670 --> 00:14:08,510
She's right. If I were a guy and..
沒錯。如果我是男人

211
00:14:13,410 --> 00:14:16,350
Did I just say, "If I were a guy"?
我剛才是不是說： 如果我是男人？

212
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:20,520
You don't need him to propose to you. Maybe you could propose to him.
別等他求婚了，主動出擊吧

213
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:24,410
Oh, I don't know. I don't know. Isn't that a little desperate?
哦，不知道，我又不是想嫁想瘋了

214
00:14:24,590 --> 00:14:26,750
I proposed to Chandler.
我向錢德求的婚

215
00:14:30,530 --> 00:14:32,500
All right, moving on.
好吧，就算是

216
00:14:32,900 --> 00:14:35,330
I don't think it was desperate. It was amazing.
我不覺得你想嫁想瘋了，我覺得你很棒

217
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:36,530
Thank you.
謝謝。

218
00:14:36,700 --> 00:14:40,800
- Well, do you think I should propose? - I think it could be kind of great.
-你們都認為我該求婚？ -那一定很棒

219
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:45,110
Absolutely. You'll love the feeling. There's nothing like it.
當然！世上再沒有比求婚更美妙的感覺了！

220
00:14:47,620 --> 00:14:50,240
Okay. Okay. So how should I do it?
好，就這麼干

221
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:52,680
How about at a game on the big screen?
在球賽的大屏幕上告白

222
00:14:53,450 --> 00:14:56,390
How about at a Foot Locker?
更老套的求婚方式如何？

223
00:14:57,420 --> 00:15:01,660
What? What, he obviously thinks that's a nice way to be proposed to.
他既然選擇過大屏幕求婚，可見他能接受這種方式

224
00:15:01,830 --> 00:15:05,290
- Plus, he'd never suspect it. - Yeah, that does make sense.
-而且他也不會起疑心 -有理

225
00:15:05,470 --> 00:15:09,130
- Okay, now, would you two like that? - Sounds good to me.
-你們會喜歡嗎？ -我喜歡

226
00:15:09,300 --> 00:15:11,570
But what would a guy think?
不過男性會怎麼想？

227
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:16,610
- Nana's on the phone. - Wow.
-奶奶電話 - 哇！

228
00:15:16,980 --> 00:15:20,440
That's interesting, since she died seven years ago.
有趣，她七年前就死了

229
00:15:20,980 --> 00:15:22,640
She did?
是嗎？

230
00:15:22,820 --> 00:15:25,050
Who got her condo in Boca?
那她在博卡的房子歸誰了？

231
00:15:26,220 --> 00:15:27,650
Hello?
喂

232
00:15:28,490 --> 00:15:30,620
It's our nanny.
是我們的保姆

233
00:15:30,790 --> 00:15:32,160
Hi.
喂

234
00:15:32,330 --> 00:15:37,290
Oh, God, I hope you feel better. Okay. Bye.
是嗎，希望你早點康復。再見

235
00:15:37,460 --> 00:15:39,060
That's Molly. She's sick.
是莫麗，她病了

236
00:15:39,230 --> 00:15:42,400
- Can you watch Emma today? - I can't. I have back-to-back classes.
-今天你看孩子可以嗎 - 不行， 我要連堂上課

237
00:15:42,570 --> 00:15:45,470
Did Molly say what she had? Because my throat's been hurting.
莫麗說她生什麼病？我的喉嚨也不舒服

238
00:15:45,640 --> 00:15:47,470
Menstrual cramps.
痛經

239
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:51,740
I don't think that's what this is.
我可能不是這毛病

240
00:15:52,950 --> 00:15:55,710
- Can any of you watch Emma? - No, I'm sorry, sweetie.
-你們幫忙看著艾瑪成嗎？ -抱歉，親愛的

241
00:15:55,880 --> 00:15:58,780
No, I've got work, and then I'm proposing.
我要上班，還要求婚

242
00:15:58,950 --> 00:16:01,480
Great. Shoot. What am I gonna do?
那怎麼辦

243
00:16:01,660 --> 00:16:03,490
Well, I could do it.
我可以幫手

244
00:16:03,660 --> 00:16:07,120
- Well, actually.. - Can I talk to you for a second?
-好 -談談？

245
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:11,730
I do not want her babysitting our child.
我不贊成。

246
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:15,490
- Why not? - For one thing, she keeps calling her Ella.
-為啥？ -首先，她老是把我們的孩子喊成「愛拉」

247
00:16:15,670 --> 00:16:19,000
- Ella's a nice name. - Fine, we'll call the next one Ella.
-這名字也不錯嘛 -好，下一胎叫"愛拉"

248
00:16:19,170 --> 00:16:21,270
- The next one? - Okay.
-下一胎？ - 好

249
00:16:22,810 --> 00:16:25,240
I don't want her watching our baby.
我不贊成她幫我們看孩子

250
00:16:25,410 --> 00:16:28,850
Ross, I am trying to help her become a better person.
我只是想改造她

251
00:16:29,020 --> 00:16:30,850
This is a huge breakthrough for her.
這是個好機會

252
00:16:31,020 --> 00:16:35,110
She just offered to do something for another human being.
可以教她為別人做點事

253
00:16:35,290 --> 00:16:36,550
You know, I don't know.
我不懂

254
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,880
Ross, I'm telling you..
羅斯，我是說

255
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:42,050
she's giving up getting her eyebrows shaped to do this, all right?
她寧願犧牲修眉的時間看孩子

256
00:16:42,230 --> 00:16:45,760
Do you understand how important that is in our world?
這件事對我們意義重大！

257
00:16:47,230 --> 00:16:52,100
Listen, I couldn't help but overhear, because I was trying to.
我不小心聽到你們的談話。 因為我想聽

258
00:16:53,670 --> 00:16:56,700
Listen, let me do this. I really want to help you guys out.
就讓我帶孩子吧，我真心想幫你們

259
00:16:56,880 --> 00:17:00,010
And plus, Rachel's been so wonderful to me.
而且，瑞秋對我太好了

260
00:17:02,550 --> 00:17:05,210
- Absolutely. - Oh, great!
-好！ -太好了!

261
00:17:05,390 --> 00:17:07,620
So how much does it pay?
付多少工錢？

262
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:16,230
How's the second draft of the letter coming?
喬伊，二稿如何？

263
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:19,730
Great. I'm finished. In fact, I just dropped it off at the agency.
殺青了，剛剛交了

264
00:17:21,870 --> 00:17:23,430
- You dropped it off? - Yeah.
-交了？ - 是啊。

265
00:17:23,600 --> 00:17:26,040
Can we read it? Can you print out another copy?
我們能讀讀嗎？再打印一份給我們？

266
00:17:26,210 --> 00:17:27,970
No can do, amigo.
哎呀，恐怕不行，

267
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:33,700
No, I didn't use the computer. It felt more personal to handwrite it.
沒用電腦，手寫的，顯得更親切

268
00:17:34,250 --> 00:17:36,440
- You handwrote it? - Yeah, and don't worry.
-還手寫？ -別擔心

269
00:17:36,620 --> 00:17:39,020
I didn't try to sound smart at all.
我根本沒有裝老練

270
00:17:40,090 --> 00:17:41,420
See you later.
再見

271
00:17:41,590 --> 00:17:45,460
Oh, my God. Oh, my God. That letter is gonna go in our file.
天，信快寄到了。

272
00:17:45,630 --> 00:17:47,320
We're never gonna get a kid.
我們沒指望了

273
00:17:47,490 --> 00:17:49,460
We're gonna be one of those old couples..
我們會孤獨終老

274
00:17:49,630 --> 00:17:53,230
that collects orchids or has a lot of birds.
養花弄鳥

275
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:55,160
It's okay. You know what?
別急

276
00:17:55,340 --> 00:17:59,070
I will just call the agency and tell them to throw out the letter.
我打電話給領養中心 請他們扔掉那封信

277
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:00,430
Okay, good.
好。

278
00:18:01,340 --> 00:18:02,810
Hello, this is Chandler Bing.
喂，我是錢德賓

279
00:18:02,980 --> 00:18:07,170
Someone just dropped off a handwritten recommendation letter and..
有人手寫了一封推薦信

280
00:18:12,450 --> 00:18:13,510
Okay.
對，對，好

281
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:17,450
Thank you. Goodbye.
謝謝，再見

282
00:18:17,620 --> 00:18:19,590
We're screwed, aren't we?
我們完蛋了，知道嗎

283
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:22,350
You know what? Just tell me on the way to the bird store.
先去買鳥，路上說給我聽

284
00:18:24,060 --> 00:18:25,550
- They loved it. - What?
-他們喜歡那封信 -什麼？

285
00:18:25,730 --> 00:18:29,600
They thought it was very smart of us to have a child write the letter.
他們說我們很聰明，叫個小孩寫推薦信

286
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:32,740
They thought Joey was a child?
他們以為喬伊是小孩？

287
00:18:32,910 --> 00:18:35,930
She guessed 8,9, based on his drawings.
他們看了他的畫，以為他只八九歲

288
00:18:39,150 --> 00:18:41,710
- Hi. - Hey, what'd you guys do today?
- 嗨！ -嗨！你們今天幹嘛了？

289
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:46,950
Ella wanted to go out, so we went shopping and got some sushi.
愛拉想上街，所以我們去購物 還買了壽司

290
00:18:47,450 --> 00:18:50,480
- That sounds like fun. - Yeah, not really.
-有趣 -也不是啦

291
00:18:50,660 --> 00:18:52,220
Babies are dull.
BB很無趣

292
00:18:53,930 --> 00:18:57,860
- Hey. Hi, how's my girl? - I'm fine.
-我家妹妹怎樣了？ -我很好

293
00:18:58,800 --> 00:19:02,530
And I got you a present for letting me stay with you.
我給你買了禮物，謝謝你留我住

294
00:19:04,140 --> 00:19:05,770
- Ready? - Yeah.
-準備好了？ - 嗯！

295
00:19:09,740 --> 00:19:11,730
You pierced her ears?
你給她穿了耳洞？

296
00:19:11,910 --> 00:19:14,750
Doesn't it make her nose look smaller?
她的鼻子看來小點了嗎？

297
00:19:17,990 --> 00:19:20,510
You pierced her ears?
你給她穿了耳洞？

298
00:19:20,690 --> 00:19:23,020
How could you do this without telling me?
竟然不徵求我同意？

299
00:19:23,190 --> 00:19:26,890
If I had told you, then it wouldn't have been a surprise, now would it?
我若先告訴你，就不是驚喜了

300
00:19:27,230 --> 00:19:28,820
I think she looks cute.
我想她看來很可愛

301
00:19:29,630 --> 00:19:31,760
But I am wrong.
但我錯了

302
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:37,000
Oh, my God. Oh, my God. Here comes Ross. He's gonna flip out.
天，羅斯會發飆的

303
00:19:37,340 --> 00:19:39,740
Why, did something happen to his falafel cart?
中東女孩不能穿耳洞嗎？

304
00:19:41,140 --> 00:19:42,900
- Hey, guys. - Ross!
- 嗨，各位！. - 羅斯！

305
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:46,940
Hi, Emma. Why is she wearing her hat so low?
嗨，艾瑪。 她的帽子幹嘛壓這麼低？

306
00:19:47,110 --> 00:19:50,980
- She can barely see. - I don't really want her to see.
-她都看不見了 -人家不想她看見嘛

307
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:52,980
Why not?
為啥？

308
00:19:53,150 --> 00:19:55,820
Because there are so many terrible sights in this world.
世界太可怕

309
00:19:55,990 --> 00:19:59,390
Like war. Or that thing in Joey's refrigerator. Remember?
有戰爭，還有喬伊冰箱裡那玩意兒

310
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:02,620
It was in a milk carton, but it looked like meat?
一隻牛奶盒，但看來像塊肉

311
00:20:03,330 --> 00:20:05,420
Come here. Come here.
快來，快來

312
00:20:05,600 --> 00:20:09,000
There she is. Hi.
看她多乖

313
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:13,670
- What? - Nothing.
-怎麼啦？ -沒啥

314
00:20:14,740 --> 00:20:16,440
Hi.
嗨！

315
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:19,540
What..?
什麼?

316
00:20:30,690 --> 00:20:34,530
- Please tell me those are clip-ons! - Oh, they're real.
-那是夾上去的？ -是戴上的

317
00:20:35,060 --> 00:20:37,360
Did she do this to her?
是她幹的？

318
00:20:37,530 --> 00:20:40,000
I told you we shouldn't have left Emma with her!
我早說過不能把艾瑪交到她手上！

319
00:20:40,170 --> 00:20:42,030
I know, I know. And you were right, Ross.
我知道了！你說得對

320
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:45,800
Okay? You are so irresponsible! I am never letting you babysit again!
你太不負責！ 絕不再讓你看孩子！

321
00:20:45,970 --> 00:20:48,100
You know what? This kid needs me, okay?
你們知道嗎？ 她需要我！

322
00:20:48,280 --> 00:20:52,010
- She needs to have a cool, fun aunt. - I'm a cool, fun aunt.
-她需要一個又酷又有趣的阿姨！ -我就是！

323
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:53,910
Okay.
好吧

324
00:20:54,350 --> 00:20:59,980
Hey! Monica can be cool and fun at organized indoor projects.
莫妮卡就是又酷又有趣，而且有條有理！

325
00:21:01,290 --> 00:21:05,250
All I wanted to do was help you try to figure out what to do with your life.
我只不過想幫你想清楚你將來想幹什麼！

326
00:21:05,430 --> 00:21:06,820
This is how you repay me?
結果呢，你還是小孩子？

327
00:21:06,990 --> 00:21:10,620
I don't need you to help me. I already know what I'm gonna do with my life.
誰稀罕你幫忙。我自己想好了

328
00:21:10,800 --> 00:21:14,530
- Oh, yeah? Since when? - Since today.
-是嗎？幾時想好的？ -今天

329
00:21:14,900 --> 00:21:19,700
I am going to be a baby stylist.
我要當BB時尚專家！

330
00:21:20,740 --> 00:21:24,010
- What? - That's not a thing!
-啊？ -有這職業嗎？

331
00:21:25,080 --> 00:21:26,600
Well, it should be.
應該有！

332
00:21:26,780 --> 00:21:29,720
I'm gonna help babies learn how to accessorize..
我要教BB如何穿戴

333
00:21:29,880 --> 00:21:33,150
what colors to wear, what clothes are slimming.
選衣裳的顏色，什麼衣服較瘦身

334
00:21:33,320 --> 00:21:37,450
- Babies don't care if they're slim! - Enter Amy.
- BB才不想苗條呢！ -如何像艾米一樣美！

335
00:21:38,030 --> 00:21:41,790
- Amy, I.. I just.. I just wanna.. - What? What are you gonna do?
- 艾米, 我要… -你想怎樣？

336
00:21:43,360 --> 00:21:46,420
No more falafel for you!
罰你永世沒有三明治吃！

337
00:21:58,550 --> 00:22:00,640
Great game, huh?
比賽很精彩

338
00:22:03,380 --> 00:22:07,620
- Why do you keep looking at the screen? - I'm not. I'm praying.
-你怎麼老瞄大屏幕？ -沒，我在禱告

339
00:22:07,790 --> 00:22:09,980
Please let the Knicks win.
請讓尼克斯隊贏吧

340
00:22:10,160 --> 00:22:12,350
Thank you, Thor.
謝謝！托爾(北歐神話中的雷神)

341
00:22:13,390 --> 00:22:16,120
- Where are you going? - I'm going to the bathroom.
-你上哪兒？ -噓噓去

342
00:22:16,300 --> 00:22:18,420
- Well, I think you should wait. - Why?
-等一會 -為啥？

343
00:22:19,600 --> 00:22:24,200
Well, if you don't hold it in, you don't get all the nutrients.
如果不憋一會，你就無法攝取所有養分

344
00:22:24,640 --> 00:22:28,370
Knicks fans, please turn your attention to the big screen on the scoreboard.
尼克斯球迷，請注意積分牌大屏幕

345
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:32,640
Someone has a special question to ask.
有人要問特別的問題

346
00:22:35,080 --> 00:22:37,980
Mike Hannigan, will you marry me?
麥克漢那根，娶我好嗎？

347
00:22:39,390 --> 00:22:43,250
Get a load of this. She's proposing to him!
看啊，她向他求婚！

348
00:22:43,420 --> 00:22:46,980
Guess we know who wears the pants in that family.
到底誰更有種？

349
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:49,790
Well, that's not very enlightened.
不要誤導觀眾！

350
00:22:53,870 --> 00:22:56,960
Boo us? Boo you!
不許噓我們！

351
00:22:58,140 --> 00:23:00,970
Odin will smite you!
你們去死！

352
00:23:07,510 --> 00:23:11,420
Hello? Yeah, this is Joey Tribbiani.
喂？我就是喬伊崔比阿尼

353
00:23:11,590 --> 00:23:13,420
Oh, hi.
哦，嗨！

354
00:23:15,120 --> 00:23:17,590
Well, I'm glad you liked my letter.
真高興你喜歡我的信

355
00:23:19,030 --> 00:23:22,620
No, my mommy and daddy aren't home right now.
我爸媽不在家

356
00:23:23,930 --> 00:23:26,420
Okay, bye-bye.
再見

357
00:23:29,140 --> 00:23:31,130
She was nice.
她真慈祥

358
00:23:32,070 --> 00:23:35,770
Joey, get Amy's bags. She is moving out.
喬伊，把艾米的箱子拿出來，她要搬走了

359
00:23:36,810 --> 00:23:41,040
- You're kicking me out? - You put holes in my baby's ears.
-你把妹妹踢出家門？ -你給我的BB穿耳洞！

360
00:23:41,210 --> 00:23:43,410
At least now people will know she's a girl!
不然大家怎麼知道她是女孩？

361
00:23:46,020 --> 00:23:48,580
I can't believe I ever even tried to help you.
不敢相信，我竟然想過要幫你！

362
00:23:48,760 --> 00:23:51,320
- You are so beyond help! - You know what?
-你不可救藥！ - 你知道嗎？

363
00:23:51,490 --> 00:23:54,480
Ever since I got here, you have been nothing but negative.
這次見面你在否定我的一切！

364
00:23:54,660 --> 00:23:56,190
- Excuse me? - You didn't want me..
-啊？ -你不准我…

365
00:23:56,360 --> 00:23:58,830
to marry the old guy with the great apartment.
不准我嫁有豪宅的老頭

366
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:03,800
Then I tried to help your daughter de-emphasize her flaws..
我想幫你把你女兒的鼻子變小點

367
00:24:03,970 --> 00:24:06,060
and suddenly I'm the bad guy?
結果吃力不討好？

368
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:10,140
- Joey, where are those bags? - She has a lot of crap!
-喬伊，行李怎麼還沒搬出來？ -她的破玩意太多了

369
00:24:10,880 --> 00:24:14,240
You know? When I moved in here, I thought, "This will be so great.
我剛搬來時，還想著太好了

370
00:24:14,410 --> 00:24:17,440
Just us sisters back together again like when we were kids."
憧憬著姐妹團聚 像童年那樣

371
00:24:17,620 --> 00:24:19,810
Except without that stupid Jill.
而且沒有該死的吉爾搗亂

372
00:24:20,920 --> 00:24:23,150
Who has gotten fat, by the way.
她變肥了

373
00:24:25,030 --> 00:24:26,360
Seriously?
真的？

374
00:24:26,860 --> 00:24:29,090
Mom said she gained, like,15 pounds.
媽說吉爾肥了15磅

375
00:24:29,260 --> 00:24:32,100
- Hips or thighs? - Ass and face.
-屁股和大腿長肉了？ -屁股和臉

376
00:24:33,500 --> 00:24:36,300
Oh, my God! I thought she was on Atkins.
天啊，她不是節食嗎？

377
00:24:36,470 --> 00:24:38,460
She was. Carbs found her.
本來是，後來被男人甩了

378
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:45,670
See? This is what I wanted.
看，這才像姐妹

379
00:24:45,850 --> 00:24:49,250
Two sisters talking about real stuff.
真心交談

380
00:24:51,850 --> 00:24:53,880
Oh, I can give you that.
哦，我可以這樣

381
00:24:54,390 --> 00:24:56,410
- You can? - Yeah.
- 你可以？ - 是的。

382
00:24:56,590 --> 00:24:59,580
I kept trying to make you a better person, but you're..
我老想改造你。實際上

383
00:24:59,760 --> 00:25:03,020
You're already a pretty perfect version of what you are.
你本來就接近完美了

384
00:25:04,030 --> 00:25:06,000
Thank you.
謝謝你

385
00:25:06,170 --> 00:25:08,830
You gotta admit, Emma does look cute.
必須承認，艾瑪真可愛

386
00:25:10,440 --> 00:25:13,930
- Did you just say, "Emma"? - Oh, I'm sorry. Ella.
-你剛說「艾瑪」？ -對不起， 愛拉

387
00:25:16,780 --> 00:25:21,270
Sis, you wanna go bring Jill some pasta?
姐, 你要給吉爾帶意大利面?

388
00:25:22,520 --> 00:25:25,950
Come on, Amy. Now, that's just wrong.
艾米. 那些是錯的.

389
00:25:26,120 --> 00:25:28,550
Her true weakness was garlic bread.
她真的怕的是大蒜奶油麵包片.

390
00:25:34,530 --> 00:25:37,460
That woman didn't know what she was talking about, Mike.
賽場裡那傢伙真是亂講

391
00:25:37,630 --> 00:25:39,930
Obviously, you have balls.
你當然有種

392
00:25:41,370 --> 00:25:44,130
- Please, let's forget the whole thing. - I would love it.
-忘了算了 -你能忘最好

393
00:25:44,300 --> 00:25:46,200
- Consider it forgotten. - Thank you.
- 已經忘了 - 謝謝

394
00:25:47,040 --> 00:25:48,700
But just so you know..
不過你知道...

395
00:25:48,880 --> 00:25:54,470
However and whenever you decide to propose, I promise I'll say yes.
不管你何時、以何方式求婚 我保證答應

396
00:25:54,950 --> 00:25:57,210
Whether, you know, it's at a basketball game..
不管是籃球賽

397
00:25:57,380 --> 00:25:59,250
or in skywriting..
還是寫在空中

398
00:25:59,420 --> 00:26:02,180
or, you know, like some lame guy in a cheesy movie..
或是像有部濫電影裡

399
00:26:02,360 --> 00:26:04,350
who hides it in the cake.
把求婚信藏在蛋糕裡

400
00:26:09,830 --> 00:26:12,560
It's in the cake, isn't it?
是蛋糕對吧？

401
00:26:13,630 --> 00:26:17,130
Where else would lame Mr. No Balls hide it?
沒種的男人還會有什麼好點子嗎

402
00:26:17,300 --> 00:26:20,240
What's the matter with me? Why do I keep ruining this?
我是怎麼了？怎麼老提這個！

403
00:26:20,410 --> 00:26:22,740
- I'm sorry. I'm sorry. - No, it's my fault.
-對不起嘛 -是我錯

404
00:26:22,910 --> 00:26:25,540
I keep trying to propose in these stupid ways..
我老用愚蠢的方式求婚

405
00:26:25,710 --> 00:26:29,810
and I just wanna tell you I love you, and I wanna spend my life with you..
我只是想告訴你 我愛你，我想和你度過餘生

406
00:26:33,820 --> 00:26:37,480
- I'm gonna do this now. - Oh, my God.
-我現在求婚 -天啊

407
00:26:40,990 --> 00:26:43,090
- Phoebe, I.. - Wait. Oh, wait.
-菲比 -暫停

408
00:26:47,800 --> 00:26:49,290
Oh, no.
暫停

409
00:26:51,940 --> 00:26:53,370
Okay.
好了。

410
00:26:54,510 --> 00:26:57,030
Ready? Okay.
可以了？

411
00:26:59,650 --> 00:27:02,380
Phoebe, I love you.
菲比，我愛你。

412
00:27:03,950 --> 00:27:08,550
There's no one else in the world I would ask to marry me three times.
這個世界只有你我會三次求婚

413
00:27:09,890 --> 00:27:12,320
But I want to take care of you..
我想照顧你

414
00:27:12,490 --> 00:27:13,930
have babies with you..
和你生兒育女

415
00:27:15,360 --> 00:27:17,490
and grow old with you.
一起變老

416
00:27:19,570 --> 00:27:22,660
Phoebe Buffay, will you marry me?
菲比布費，你願意嫁我嗎

417
00:27:23,670 --> 00:27:25,400
Yes.
我願意！

418
00:27:31,910 --> 00:27:34,440
- I love you. - I love you more.
-我愛你 -我愛你更多

419
00:27:34,610 --> 00:27:35,810
Not possible.
不可能

420
00:27:45,330 --> 00:27:47,920
She's gonna be Mrs. No Balls!
她是「沒種夫人」了

421
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:56,460
So how's the baby-styling business going?
「BB時尚專家」好當嗎？

422
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:58,900
Not that great.
行情不大好

423
00:27:59,070 --> 00:28:02,740
It's almost as if people don't want to hear that their babies are ugly.
好像大家都不愛聽見他們的BB丑

424
00:28:03,840 --> 00:28:06,400
That's shocking.
吃驚

425
00:28:07,610 --> 00:28:10,580
There's Ross. Hey, Ross.
那不是羅斯嗎？羅斯！！！

426
00:28:12,090 --> 00:28:14,710
Hello, Ross?
你好，羅斯！

427
00:28:16,260 --> 00:28:17,780
He's rude.
真沒教養

428
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


429
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


